    "sections": {
        "description": "ST Fitness is a modern, responsive, and feature-rich WordPress theme designed for fitness professionals, gyms, health clubs, personal trainers, yoga studios, wellness centers, sports academies, and crossfit facilities. Its clean design and intuitive layout help you create a professional website that showcases your services, training programs, schedules, trainers, testimonials, and success stories. Built with performance and usability in mind, ST Fitness offers a fully responsive layout that looks great on desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. The theme is compatible with the drag and drop builder, allowing you to customize pages using core Gutenberg blocks without requiring coding knowledge."
